{"term":{"label":"禮","occurrences":7,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"5B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii","title":"萬章下","description":"孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"使","id":"使"},{"form":"侯","id":"侯"},{"form":"友","id":"友"},{"form":"君","id":"君"},{"form":"善","id":"善"},{"form":"國","id":"國"},{"form":"士","id":"士"},{"form":"後","id":"後"},{"form":"斯","id":"斯"},{"form":"欲","id":"欲"},{"form":"禮","id":"禮"},{"form":"諸","id":"諸"},{"form":"足","id":"足"},{"form":"門","id":"門"},{"form":"餽","id":"餽"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.665490586683414,"source":"門","target":"今"},{"weight":1.486835590341768,"source":"門","target":"國"},{"weight":2.1058747987479913,"source":"門","target":"使"},{"weight":1.486835590341768,"source":"門","target":"諸"},{"weight":2.4423470353692043,"source":"門","target":"欲"},{"weight":2.4423470353692043,"source":"門","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.6107656869941676,"source":"諸","target":"侯"},{"weight":2.1799827709017134,"source":"諸","target":"今"},{"weight":0.30818059400012193,"source":"諸","target":"士"},{"weight":0.30818059400012193,"source":"諸","target":"國"},{"weight":1.3690525546853844,"source":"諸","target":"後"},{"weight":1.9568392195875035,"source":"諸","target":"禮"},{"weight":0.9272198024063453,"source":"諸","target":"使"},{"weight":1.988091763091608,"source":"使","target":"後"},{"weight":1.8181927262962105,"source":"斯","target":"友"},{"weight":2.847812143477369,"source":"斯","target":"善"},{"weight":1.1991535178899873,"source":"斯","target":"士"},{"weight":0.7936884097818228,"source":"斯","target":"國"},{"weight":1.1895840668738364,"source":"足","target":"友"},{"weight":2.2192034840549946,"source":"足","target":"善"},{"weight":0.5705448584676129,"source":"足","target":"士"},{"weight":2.7300291078209855,"source":"餽","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.03688192726104,"sou